        <profile id="c025530e" name="Heroic Last Stand" typeId="a915f3e9" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2451ab48">In the Fight phase, when this model is destroyed, if this unit has not been selected to fight this phase, roll one D6: on a 2+, do not remove this model from the battlefield. When this unit has fought, or at the end of the phase (whichever comes first), this model is removed from the battlefield.</characteristic>
